---

With these three patches in place:

- Your Storybook configs will surface an **Expressive** variant for Button and List.  
- Your React wrappers will consume the `expressive` flag and output the proper CSS class (`--btn--expressive` or `--list--expressive`).  

All that remains is to define the matching CSS rules in your Sass (e.g. `.bx--btn--expressive { height: 48px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }` and `.bx--list--expressive { font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; }`).
